{
  "name": "Daily job list to each cleaner or field worker on Telegram",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "16ffa409-05c4-5b96-a29f-b4367334c732",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"telegram_chat_id\": \"123456789\",\n    \"sheet_url\": \"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID/edit\",\n    \"sheet_tab\": \"Jobs\",\n    \"business_name\": \"Your Business\"\n  }\n}",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1c88f17a-73a5-590c-bbb7-0a5aadda836e",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_url }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_tab }}"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "05624006-3770-51d2-a291-ffbaf72f3224",
      "name": "Read jobs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const today = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\nconst by = {};\nfor (const { json: r } of $input.all()) {\n  if (String(r.date || '').slice(0, 10) !== today || !r.worker_chat_id) continue;\n  (by[r.worker_chat_id] = by[r.worker_chat_id] || []).push(r);\n}\nreturn Object.entries(by).map(([chat, jobs]) => ({ json: { chat_id: chat, worker: jobs[0].worker || '',\n  text: `Good morning ${jobs[0].worker || ''}! Your jobs today:\\n\\n` + jobs.sort((a, b) => String(a.time).localeCompare(String(b.time)))\n    .map((j, i) => `${i + 1}. ${j.time || ''} ${j.client || ''}\\n   ${j.address || ''}\\n   ${j.notes || ''}`.trimEnd()).join('\\n\\n') } }));"
      },
      "id": "31ff9535-47e4-58bf-aa28-f4de95e6ee34",
      "name": "Group today's jobs by worker",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "f63c26b9-a3fa-5d95-9aa2-733af6140160",
      "name": "Send each worker their list",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily job list to each cleaner or field worker on Telegram\nEvery morning sends each worker their jobs for the day (time, client, address, notes) on Telegram, from one schedule sheet.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e939b025-950e-5003-a8a9-cc2e9602eaaa",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Create a Telegram bot with **@BotFather** and add its token as a Telegram credential in n8n. Send your bot a message, then get your chat ID (for example from @userinfobot).\n2. Make a sheet tab **Jobs** with the headers in `sheet-headers.csv`. Each worker messages your bot once; put their chat ID in `worker_chat_id`.\n3. Open **Settings**: sheet URL. Connect Google Sheets and Telegram.\n4. Run it once with test data, then switch to **Active**.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c833d4c5-e826-5434-b6e3-536295ac3aaf",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -420
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
